      "created_at": "2012-05-29T16:53:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My reading would be that he dealt damage, but he did not take damage.  The NPCU only replaces “takes damage” with “takes no damage”  and the taking damage trigger requires something to be dealing damage.</p>",
