      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/46a35a/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-05-29T21:43:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think “would” and “instead” are the key words here. They imply that AZ “would” (but doesn’t) take damage. “Instead” (in place of that) he regains hit points. So he is never dealt damage.</p>",
